e in us-east, us-west and eu-west, failing health checks with an 18% error rate. Its release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) had also been unhealthy in staging.\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. All three regions now run it, the service passes health checks, and the error rate is down to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001, \"checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks; rolled back to v2.3.0\". It records the failure, what I rolled back to and the improvement afterwards. The listed follow-up is to find out why v2.3.1 broke before deploying it again.", "type": "text"}]}]}